{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sasaeng (\uc0ac\uc0dd): An obsessive fan who invades a celebrity\u2019s private life, often following them excessively and disregarding personal boundaries.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are two endings. We recommend watching both endings.\u00a0(Hint below)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 ~ 1.5 hour</strong> for first-time players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life \u2014 fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff caf\u00e9, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Hint</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #1. Find something in the kitchen to use as a weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #2. Survive by holding out time</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857420?t=1757031681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857420?t=1757031681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/202d05f8481909fbde95cdd93882a5568f00526e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757031681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/202d05f8481909fbde95cdd93882a5568f00526e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757031681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements involving obsessive behavior, stalking, and disturbing imagery.\r\nThere are scenes of blood, implied violence, and moments that may cause emotional discomfort."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/8902904f6781625410671d6d56216deb.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sasaeng (\uc0ac\uc0dd): An obsessive fan who invades a celebrity\u2019s private life, often following them excessively and disregarding personal boundaries.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are two endings. We recommend watching both endings.\u00a0(Hint below)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>About 1 ~ 1.5 hour</strong> for first-time players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter save system</strong> supported.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/82b1aff7c7c44a881a75f5208b933d22.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glamorous life of a K-POP idol, and the fanatical obsession and dark shadow lurking behind it. Watched by an unknown presence, who will you trust, and what will you doubt?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/extras/fb5fda05c8a4a9e3db4d02433526d213.avif?t=1757031681\" width=462 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your successful debut, you begin to feel an unknown gaze in your daily life. The attention you once believed was simple fan adoration turns into madness, now approaching as a threat that seems to see right through you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life of a K-pop Idol</strong>:<br>Experience a day in the life \u2014 fan letters, vocal training, fan sign events. But not everything goes well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Entertainment Agency</strong>:<br>Move freely through practice rooms, offices, staff caf\u00e9, and restrooms to uncover clues and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>:<br>A creeping sense of being watched builds tension through subtle detail and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Luxury Apartment with Secrets</strong>:<br>What once felt safe now seems strangely unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:<br>There are 2 different endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move<br>Shift - Run<br>E - Interact<br>ESC - Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ending Hint</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #1. Find something in the kitchen to use as a weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending #2. Survive by holding out time</p>","developers":["Jayhyeon Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857420/86542b9b869b1b1a4f619ee7ce23653028c87a00/header.jpg?t=1757031681","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257178936,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178936/movie480.mp4?t=1754465975","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178936/movie_max.mp4?t=1754465975"},"name":"Sasaeng Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/